    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n6542" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀναθετέον</span></b> , (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνατίθημι</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>one must
				put off,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				935e
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. τὴν ἄμυναν εἰς τὸν χρόνον</span>”
